# SVG assets

## Goal
Icons should be **tintable** from React Native SVG (`color` prop) while defaulting to **black** when no color is passed.

## Rules
- On the root `<svg>` element: set `color="#000000"` (fallback when the parent does not set `color`).
- Replace hard-coded paint on shapes:
  - strokes: `stroke="currentColor"` (avoid `stroke="white"` / fixed hex unless product requires it)
  - fills: `fill="currentColor"` (same idea)
- Do not maintain separate “white” / “black” variants of the same glyph if `currentColor` is enough.

## Usage from code
Pass the tint via the generated component’s `color` prop (e.g. `color="#..."` or a resolved design token). Prefer `DsIcon` when the icon is in the registry.
